# Pairs with HandOffBound. Moved from the design's
# ReadPositionHonestDrainPointOnly. Batch appends carry no initiator stamp - the
# shape of the shard fold's serial-turn guard, which excludes point writes and
# only counts batches - so a batch admitted before the close is accepted after it.
MODULE: HandOffBoundDrainPointOnly
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: batch appends bypass the initiator's fence, so the close drains point writes only
PERTURBS: ForeignAlloc, ForeignReject

--- FIND
    /\ fpend
    /\ fstamp >= fFence
--- REPLACE
    /\ fpend
\* MUTATION: a batch append is not checked.
    /\ (fkind = "batch" \/ fstamp >= fFence)
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ fpend
    /\ fstamp < fFence
--- REPLACE
    /\ fpend
    /\ fkind = "point"
    /\ fstamp < fFence
--- END
